doc:sch-4-sec-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9 Schedule 3," ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "items 115 and 116 The later of: (a) the start of the 28th day after the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent; and (b) immediately after the commencement of item 82 of Schedule 2 to the Same-Sex Relationships (Equal Treatment in Commonwealth Laws—General Law Reform) Act 2008. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer .

