concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-4-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Each Act, and each set of regulations, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  Schedule 1  Age discrimination" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Each Act, and each set of regulations, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  Schedule 1  Age discrimination"@en ;
