concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-1-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Act done because of age and for other reason"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an act is done for 2 or more reasons; and  (b) one of the reasons (whether or not it is the dominant or a substantial reason) is:  (i) the age of a person; or  (ii) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of the age of a person; or  (iii) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of the age of a person.  (2) For the purposes of this Act, the act referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is taken to be done because of the age of the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an act is done for 2 or more reasons; and  (b) one of the reasons (whether or not it is the dominant or a substantial reason) is:  (i) the age of a person; or  (ii) a characteristic that appertains generally to persons of the age of a person; or  (iii) a characteristic that is generally imputed to persons of the age of a person.  (2) For the purposes of this Act, the act referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is taken to be done because of the age of the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8b901c72c22862c071feb94dbded2d88c9877a7902b5ffb7752a72731c11859f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-1-sec-16-ss-1 ;
