concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-13 cml:asserts concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-13-logic-alleninterval-3 .
