concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-11-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Unjustifiable hardship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-11-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, in determining whether a hardship that would be imposed on a person (the first person) would be an unjustifiable hardship, all relevant circumstances of the particular case must be taken into account, including the following:  (a) the nature of the benefit or detriment likely to accrue to, or to be suffered by, any person concerned;  (b) the effect of the disability of any person concerned;  (c) the financial circumstances, and the estimated amount of expenditure required to be made, by the first person;  (d) the availability of financial and other assistance to the first person;  Schedule 2  Disability discrimination" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, in determining whether a hardship that would be imposed on a person (the first person) would be an unjustifiable hardship, all relevant circumstances of the particular case must be taken into account, including the following:  (a) the nature of the benefit or detriment likely to accrue to, or to be suffered by, any person concerned;  (b) the effect of the disability of any person concerned;  (c) the financial circumstances, and the estimated amount of expenditure required to be made, by the first person;  (d) the availability of financial and other assistance to the first person;  Schedule 2  Disability discrimination"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6ae2da73c659e602f9dab184fd7614df8f2d81b8f7d9931a349d5c06a7632660" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consideration of relevant circumstances when determining an unjustifiable hardship" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009.pdf> ;
