concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-63 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63 Saving—disability standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-63 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies in relation to a disability standard:  (a) made under section 31 of the Disability Discrimination Act 1992; and  (b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part. (2) The disability standard has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it had been made under that section as amended by this Part." ;
