concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-71 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71 At the end of section 45"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-71 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:  (a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure referred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not necessary for implementing the measure; or  (b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities. Note: For discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d)." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:  (a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure referred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not necessary for implementing the measure; or  (b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities. Note: For discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7843659281cfe9c33a069becf16963781d48d62a42bb73953c32111fbeb443d5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption from discrimination in implementing a measure not necessary for its implementation or in relation to rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
