doc:sch-2-sec-71 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "71 At the end of section 45" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) However, subsection (1) does not apply:  (a) in relation to discrimination in implementing a measure referred to in that subsection if the discrimination is not necessary for implementing the measure; or  (b) in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities. Note: For discrimination in relation to the rates of salary or wages paid to persons with disabilities, see paragraphs 47(1)(c) and (d)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer .

