concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-2-sec-86 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86 Saving—action plans"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-86 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies in relation to an action plan:  (a) given to the Commission under section 64 of the Disability Discrimination Act 1992; and  (b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part. (2) The action plan has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it had been given to the Commission under that section as amended by this Part." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies in relation to an action plan:  (a) given to the Commission under section 64 of the Disability Discrimination Act 1992; and  (b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part. (2) The action plan has effect, from the commencement of this Part, as if it had been given to the Commission under that section as amended by this Part."@en ;
