concept:disability-discrimination-and-other-human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2009-sch-3-sec-158 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-158 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subsection 47(2) of the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission Act 1986, as amended by this Part, applies to declarations made after the commencement of this Part. (2) Subsection 47(3) of the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission Act 1986, as amended by this Part, applies to declarations made before, on or after the commencement of this Part." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subsection 47(2) of the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission Act 1986, as amended by this Part, applies to declarations made after the commencement of this Part. (2) Subsection 47(3) of the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission Act 1986, as amended by this Part, applies to declarations made before, on or after the commencement of this Part."@en ;
